on":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689723","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4606550-1846018067934745","game_id":"steam-4606550","kind":"announcement","title":"DevLog #2 - Creditors, the Junkman and the Shop Computer","summary":"Welcome to our second developer log! In the first one, we ended our core loop with \"Pay Debts!\" This time we'll show you who those debts are owed to, where the raw materials from your dismantled items go, and what's waiting for you on the shop's computer.Creditors at the DoorWhen you take over the shop, you don't just inherit its shelves — you inherit its debts too. Every creditor has their own amount owed, due day and interest rate.When the due day comes, the creditor stops by your shop in the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T21:39:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934745","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4606550-1844751498232466","game_id":"steam-4606550","kind":"announcement","title":"DevLog #1 - Welcome to Rust & Reveal!","summary":"Welcome to our first developer log for Rust & Reveal: Restoration Simulator! In Rust & Reveal, everything starts with the things other people have thrown away. Search through the town's trash and try to collect potentially valuable items before the garbage truck arrives. But not everything you find has to share the same fate. Take promising items back to your workshop to clean and restore them. If something is not worth saving, dismantle it and turn it into raw materials. Display the items you c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T20:26:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.